# Source is served raw from GitHub straight into other people's projects, so it
# is stored and checked out with LF everywhere. Nothing here is Windows-specific.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Recorded media is committed (the site host serves it; raw GitHub and LFS both
# draw on a 1GB/month tier that one traffic spike would exhaust). No LFS: the
# budget is capped in tools/recorder instead — see AGENTS.md.
*.mp4  binary
*.webm binary
*.jpg  binary
*.png  binary
*.woff2 binary
